  {
   "@id": "https://kolaboro.com/data/#undescribed-monitoring-json",
   "@type": "dcat:Dataset",
   "dct:identifier": "undescribed-monitoring-json",
   "dct:title": "monitoring.json",
   "dct:description": "Not yet described in the catalog registry. The file describes itself as: Synthetic monitoring: the 20 key pages of kolaboro.com loaded once per run, from outside Cloudflare, with status, time to the last byte and bytes on the wire. Runs inside the existing deploy guard job (after each code deploy and once a day); 30 days are kept. The edge also checks the same pages every 5 minutes: /api/x/status/pages.",
